                                   <<<    SOFTWARE PIPELINING(IPC: 0.52, ITR: 48, MVE: 2, POL: S)
                                   <<<    PREFETCH(HARD) Expected by compiler :
                                   <<<      kmax, cnvflg, xlamx, xlamud
