            1406                     !! where \f$\Delta V\f$ is the integrated horizontal shear over the cloud depth, \f$\Delta z\f$, (the ratio is converted to units of \f$10^{-3} s^{-1}\f$). The variable "edto" is \f$1-E\f$ and is constrained to the range \f$[0,0.9]\f$.
